    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f9df36405a93142c835ca6d497e44216.poster.avif?t=1749928516\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f9df36405a93142c835ca6d497e44216.webm?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f9df36405a93142c835ca6d497e44216.mp4?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own world in Rhythm Town, a relaxing sandbox where everything moves to the beat of your music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/34f2bb65ec97b979b793f5c0b5c10909.avif?t=1749928516\" width=469 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/e6a8cb71e347c51baca9b5b75340731d.poster.avif?t=1749928516\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/e6a8cb71e347c51baca9b5b75340731d.webm?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/e6a8cb71e347c51baca9b5b75340731d.mp4?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every object in your world comes to life, shifting and swaying perfectly in sync with the rhythm.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/ff3f2db47c9b335e359fb973d1978b56.avif?t=1749928516\" width=502 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/d608e07dfc24095a731bf431f8962a3c.poster.avif?t=1749928516\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/d608e07dfc24095a731bf431f8962a3c.webm?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/d608e07dfc24095a731bf431f8962a3c.mp4?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your favorite tracks, and watch as your creation transforms to match the energy of the music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f121621ec443c792a7b5dadff52ad1ac.avif?t=1749928516\" width=592 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals, no stress\u2014just pure creative freedom as you craft a vibrant, ever-moving world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f9df36405a93142c835ca6d497e44216.poster.avif?t=1749928516\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f9df36405a93142c835ca6d497e44216.webm?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f9df36405a93142c835ca6d497e44216.mp4?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own world in Rhythm Town, a relaxing sandbox where everything moves to the beat of your music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/34f2bb65ec97b979b793f5c0b5c10909.avif?t=1749928516\" width=469 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/e6a8cb71e347c51baca9b5b75340731d.poster.avif?t=1749928516\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/e6a8cb71e347c51baca9b5b75340731d.webm?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/e6a8cb71e347c51baca9b5b75340731d.mp4?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every object in your world comes to life, shifting and swaying perfectly in sync with the rhythm.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/ff3f2db47c9b335e359fb973d1978b56.avif?t=1749928516\" width=502 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/d608e07dfc24095a731bf431f8962a3c.poster.avif?t=1749928516\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/d608e07dfc24095a731bf431f8962a3c.webm?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/d608e07dfc24095a731bf431f8962a3c.mp4?t=1749928516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your favorite tracks, and watch as your creation transforms to match the energy of the music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533630/extras/f121621ec443c792a7b5dadff52ad1ac.avif?t=1749928516\" width=592 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals, no stress\u2014just pure creative freedom as you craft a vibrant, ever-moving world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rhythm Town is a cozy music-driven sandbox where your world moves to the beat. Upload your favorite tracks from your PC, place objects freely, and watch as everything sways, pulses, and comes to life with the rhythm. No challenges or pressure\u2014just pure creativity and musical relaxation.",
